title SSO Infrastructure on AWS EKS

Users [icon: users]

AWS Edge [icon: aws] {
  Route53 [icon: aws-route-53]
  ALB [icon: aws-elb, label: "Application Load Balancer"]
}

EKS Cluster [icon: aws-eks] {
  Traefik [icon: server, label: "Traefik Ingress"]

  Identity [color: purple] {
    Authentik [icon: lock, label: "Authentik IdP (sso.company.com)"]
  }

  Applications [color: blue] {
    ArgoCD [icon: argo]
    Grafana [icon: grafana]
    Argo Workflows [icon: argo, label: "Argo Workflows"]
    Airflow [icon: airflow]
    Cost Monitoring [color: blue] {
      OAuth2 Proxy [icon: shield, label: "oauth2-proxy"]
      Kubecost [icon: dollar-sign]
    }
  }

  Secrets Management [color: orange] {
    External Secrets Operator [icon: key, label: "External Secrets Operator"]
    K8s Secrets [icon: k8s-secret, label: "K8s Secrets"]
  }

  GitOps [color: green] {
    ArgoCD Deployer [icon: argo, label: "ArgoCD (GitOps Controller)"]
  }
}

AWS Services [icon: aws] {
  Secrets Manager [icon: aws-secrets-manager]
  AWS Console Dev [icon: aws-iam, label: "AWS Console (Dev)"]
  AWS Console Prd [icon: aws-iam, label: "AWS Console (Prd)"]
  AWS CLI [icon: terminal, label: "AWS CLI (PKCE)"]
}

Git Repo [icon: github]

// Traffic flow
Users > Route53
Route53 > ALB
ALB > Traefik
Traefik > ArgoCD
Traefik > Grafana
Traefik > Argo Workflows: Route / Auto-redirect
Traefik > Airflow
Traefik > OAuth2 Proxy
OAuth2 Proxy > Kubecost: Proxy

// Authentication flows
ArgoCD <--> Authentik: OIDC
Grafana <--> Authentik: Generic OAuth
Argo Workflows <--> Authentik: OIDC + Traefik Middleware
Airflow <--> Authentik: Flask OAuth
OAuth2 Proxy <--> Authentik: OIDC

// AWS authentication
Authentik --> AWS Console Dev: SAML
Authentik --> AWS Console Prd: SAML
Authentik --> AWS CLI: OIDC (public client)

// Secrets flow
External Secrets Operator <-- Secrets Manager: pull credentials
External Secrets Operator > K8s Secrets: inject
K8s Secrets --> ArgoCD
K8s Secrets --> Argo Workflows
K8s Secrets --> Airflow
K8s Secrets --> OAuth2 Proxy

// GitOps deployment
Git Repo --> ArgoCD Deployer: sync
ArgoCD Deployer --> Applications: deploy

legend {
  [connection: ">", label: "Traffic flow"]
  [connection: "<->", label: "Authentication flow"]
  [connection: "-->", label: "Async / GitOps sync"]
}
